      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "\"Section 1. Deferred Compensation Board\nEstablished. The Deferred Compensation Board\n(hereinafter called the Board) is hereby\nestablished in the Office of the Mayor to take\nall steps necessary to the preparation and\nimplementation of deferred compensation plans\npursuant to Section 401(k) and/or Section 457\nof the Internal Revenue Code of 1954, as\namended, and any relevant provisions of State\nlaw for the following persons:",
