    {
      "bbox": [
        587,
        1444,
        1317,
        1871
      ],
      "category": "List-item",
      "text": "(a) employees of the City of New York in\ntitles not certified to or represented by a\ncollective bargaining representative pursuant to\nArticle 14 of the Civil Service Law (the Taylor\nLaw), and Chapter 54 of the Administrative\nCode of the City of New York (the New York\nCity Collective Bargaining Law). Employees of\nthe City of New York who are included in a\nunit of employees covered by a collective\nbargaining agreement may participate in the\nplan if the collective bargaining agreement\ncovering such employees provides for coverage\nunder the plan.",
